Career Stream uses a provider-based connector architecture.

Current provider types include:

Workday
Greenhouse
Amazon/custom
Browser-based public source handling

Each connector converts source-specific data into a common job structure.

Source
  ↓
Connector
  ↓
RawJob
  ↓
Validation
  ↓
Experience Filter
  ↓
Normalization
  ↓
Database
